{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;story&quot; and &quot;texts&quot; are puzzle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cat puzzle game where you use &quot;text&quot; to push the cat. If letter WASD appears in the text, you can push it! You need to push the cat to the goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/30225f7d914a5f93c18766c561a945fc.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" width=616 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/30225f7d914a5f93c18766c561a945fc.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Puzzle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry if you can't solve the puzzle. There are in-game hints and solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/65e028f88a8d0a4909d7e5aae803a38e.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/65e028f88a8d0a4909d7e5aae803a38e.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>If you like to solve very difficult puzzles, there are 13 extra challenge levels for you to solve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/a5cea6801b3de992e74c76737cf04bc4.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/a5cea6801b3de992e74c76737cf04bc4.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>These levels are intricately crafted with heart and soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do You push cats often?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat pushing experts believe that it is good for mental health if you push cats every now and then.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, pushing cats is a challenging task. It requires perseverance, patience, and determination. Be prepared physically, mentally and emotionally!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By pushing the cat, you are pushing the cat to think, to remember why they are stuck in this game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/201fc394569e6e9753665b386714c8b2.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/201fc394569e6e9753665b386714c8b2.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/201fc394569e6e9753665b386714c8b2.mp4?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Push the Cat with WASD&quot; is definitely one of the games ever made!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This &quot;game&quot; will try to answer some of the deepest philosophical questions that are very important to humanity and our everyday life, for example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Why push cat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Why is cat here?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What if you can't push the cat? (Oh no!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the goal of the cat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the name of the cat? (Spoilers: It is Push)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Why is cat there?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the conversion of consciousness?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the conversion of consciousness?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the conversion of consciousness?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/59c6d63ada4009e4be190c32e9a12df2.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" width=616 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/59c6d63ada4009e4be190c32e9a12df2.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More About this Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game from GMTK Game Jam 2023 with the theme &quot;roles reversed&quot;. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Push The Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/a9bcc9734c85518f10ba9e8cc1305c4bc02a1eb7.jpg"},{"name":"Daisy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/4ab4454b035ed3999142b5c9383df328fe6f13b6.jpg"},{"name":"Can you hear me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/55487fc3f2263aa71913b910583d231192c1505b.jpg"},{"name":"Soul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/455398a7867eae5ab138120ee56ea3cdab431fd0.jpg"},{"name":"It was raining","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/52d45e8db4ff9232b30f097f2f31ba1d25c91237.jpg"},{"name":"Happy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/7c324aadf5d4265e8c15ab52adcf366e6a5b12b9.jpg"},{"name":"To Be Continued...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/a89ecf5c629611511d1173146ba061c85ce09c27.jpg"},{"name":"Stay Hydrated!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/63d946b7ee2268bcd44707ca659e035bc10b256b.jpg"},{"name":"Certified Cat Pushing Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2683570/5e2bd43440f420753aaf69347fa7128a606c10af.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2683570?t=1757762493","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2683570?t=1757762493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757762493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757762493","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2744120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;story&quot; and &quot;texts&quot; are puzzle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cat puzzle game where you use &quot;text&quot; to push the cat. If letter WASD appears in the text, you can push it! You need to push the cat to the goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/30225f7d914a5f93c18766c561a945fc.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" width=616 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/30225f7d914a5f93c18766c561a945fc.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Puzzle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry if you can't solve the puzzle. There are in-game hints and solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/65e028f88a8d0a4909d7e5aae803a38e.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/65e028f88a8d0a4909d7e5aae803a38e.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>If you like to solve very difficult puzzles, there are 13 extra challenge levels for you to solve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/a5cea6801b3de992e74c76737cf04bc4.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/a5cea6801b3de992e74c76737cf04bc4.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>These levels are intricately crafted with heart and soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do You push cats often?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat pushing experts believe that it is good for mental health if you push cats every now and then.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, pushing cats is a challenging task. It requires perseverance, patience, and determination. Be prepared physically, mentally and emotionally!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By pushing the cat, you are pushing the cat to think, to remember why they are stuck in this game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/201fc394569e6e9753665b386714c8b2.poster.avif?t=1757762493\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/201fc394569e6e9753665b386714c8b2.webm?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683570/extras/201fc394569e6e9753665b386714c8b2.mp4?t=1757762493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Push the Cat with WASD&quot; is definitely one of the games ever made!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This &quot;game&quot; will try to answer some of the deepest philosophical questions that are very important to humanity and our everyday life, for example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Why push cat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Why is cat here?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What if you can't push the cat? (Oh no!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the goal of the cat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the name of the cat? (Spoilers: It is Push)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Why is cat there?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the conversion of consciousness?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the conversion of consciousness?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What is the conversion of consciousness?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img